                    </h2>
                    <ul class="font-mono text-sm text-brand-light/60 space-y-4 mb-4">
                        <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-brand-primary block animate-pulse"></span> SYSTEM: ONLINE</li>
                        <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-brand-primary block"></span> FOCUS: SERVICE DOMINATION</li>
