                </p>
                
                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 items-center">
                    <a href="/about" class="inline-flex justify-center w-full sm:w-auto items-center gap-3 bg-transparent border border-brand-primary/50 hover:bg-brand-primary/10 text-brand-primary px-8 py-4 font-bold font-mono tracking-widest text-sm transition-all uppercase group">
                        [ LEARN MORE ABOUT US ]
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
            
        </div>
